  "description": "New Year's Eve Con is an annual non-alcoholic, all-ages furry New Year's party hosted by members of the Lake Area Furry Friends (LAFF) in the Chicago area of Illinois. It has been held at different places since 1997, and since 2004 the proceeds have gone to charities chosen by the hosts. Recent events have run from early evening until \"regret o'clock\" on New Year's Day at hotels near Oak Brook and Elmhurst.",
